  helpLongWhat_admin_interior_vendors:
    'Manage the vendor directory and per-project contracts (payments, deliveries, completion) in tabs. Saving a contract adds the vendor to the directory.',
  helpLongHow_admin_interior_vendors:
    '① Vendor list tab: register and edit subcontractors.\n② Vendors & contracts tab: select a project, track dates, and pick vendors from the directory.\n③ Frequently used vendors sort by use count and last used date.',
  helpLongWhat_admin_interior_specs: 'This screen is for “Specs, finishes, and hand-off to procurement”. The exact store scope, tabs, and fields depend on your role, org, and process (head office vs franchise, accounting close, etc.). External systems (POS, bank, cloud) may have replication delay or concurrency rules; refresh before you rely on balances. Use PII, payroll, and tax data with least privilege, and be careful with exports and screenshots outside approved channels.',
